" class=\"Grid-styles__GridStyled-sc-772acff9-0 kYsqtw\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">US commander says mental health a &#x27;priority&#x27; on USS Lincoln</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Dundee-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-50abbc98-0 eUixcX\">Adm Brad Cooper acknowledged that navy service at sea for long periods is &quot;uniquely challenging and tough&quot;, following a visit to the warship.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataDateStyled-sc-10966952-1 feNzEJ\">41 mins ago</span><div data-testid=\"card-metadata-separator\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__Separator-sc-10966952-3 decXPj\"></div><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataTagStyled-sc-10966952-2 ewmvhB\">US &amp; Canada</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 gxFJdW\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/cqjxx2gzd9qo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-article\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardStyled-sc-50abbc98-1 jHXbAb\"><div data-testid=\"card-image-wrapper\" class=\"Dundee-styles__ImageWrapperStyled-sc-50abbc98-3 ejTXUZ\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardMediaStyled-sc-50abbc98-4 gZwtmn\"><div class=\"Image-styles__ImageCardStyled-sc-8c99a12b-1 erovmj\"><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260729-174851-148577b706-web-3.17.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 kpUtIW hide-when-no-script\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"/><img sizes=\"25vw\" srcSet=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"Three surviving panels of Antonello da Messina&#x27;s San Gregorio Polyptych, showing the Virgin Mary and Christ, St Gregory and St Benedict\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 cVsHni\"/></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Grid-styles__GridStyled-sc-772acff9-0 kYsqtw\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">Four &#x27;extraordinary&#x27; Renaissance paintings stolen from Italian museum</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Dundee-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-50abbc98-0 eUixcX\">The works were taken overnight without alarms being triggered, raising suspicion of a professional hit.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><sp