577b706-web-3.17.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 kpUtIW hide-when-no-script\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"/><img sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/2d06/live/d689cf40-995d-11f1-9712-2936f8c80214.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/2d06/live/d689cf40-995d-11f1-9712-2936f8c80214.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/2d06/live/d689cf40-995d-11f1-9712-2936f8c80214.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/2d06/live/d689cf40-995d-11f1-9712-2936f8c80214.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/2d06/live/d689cf40-995d-11f1-9712-2936f8c80214.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/2d06/live/d689cf40-995d-11f1-9712-2936f8c80214.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/2d06/live/d689cf40-995d-11f1-9712-2936f8c80214.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/2d06/live/d689cf40-995d-11f1-9712-2936f8c80214.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A crane winches an overturned bus up on the side of the road as firefighters look on. \" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 cVsHni\"/></div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 enDfsg\"><div class=\"London-styles__LondonAnchorStyled-sc-269f9f6d-0 kRdcYr\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/ckg4424zd7go\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"London-styles__LondonTextAreaAnchorStyled-sc-269f9f6d-2 qdrfG\"><div class=\"London-styles__LondonTextAreaStyled-sc-269f9f6d-1 jhVwJw\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 GrFgy\">Twelve killed as Polish bus veers off Hungarian motorway</h2></div></div><p class=\"London-styles__LondonDescriptionStyled-sc-269f9f6d-5 gZeOt\">Dozens more are seriously injured after the tourist bus overturned in the early hours of Sunday morning.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataDateStyled-sc-10966952-1 feNzEJ\">10 hrs ago</span><div data-testid=\"card-metadata-separator\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__Separator-sc-10966952-3 decXPj\"></div><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataTagStyled-sc-10966952-2 ewmvhB\">Europe</span></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 iyvWEG\"><div class=\"Grid-styles__GridStyled-sc-70d90311-0 hGwupz\"><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 fslKTl\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/cn5nnlq2pwpo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-article\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardStyled-sc-50abbc98-1 jHXbAb\"><div data-testid=\"card-image-wrapper\" class=\"Dundee-styles__ImageWrapperStyled-sc-50abbc98-3 ejTXUZ\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardMediaStyled-sc-50abbc98-4 gZwtmn\"><div class=\"Image-styles__ImageCardStyled-sc-8c99a12b-1 erovmj\"><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260729-174851-148577b706-web-3.17.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 kpUtIW hide-when-no-script\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"/><img sizes=\"25vw\" srcSet=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/17b6/live/72212bd0-9961-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/17b6/live/72212bd0-9961-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/17b6/live/72212bd0-9961-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/17b6/live/72212bd0-9961-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/17b6/live/72212bd0-9961-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/17b6/live/72212bd0-9961-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/17b6/live/72212bd0-9961-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/17b6/live/72212bd0-9961-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A statue of the Virgin Mary rises out of green and yellow fields in Poland on a cloudy sky. \" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 cVsHni\"/></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Grid-styles__GridStyled-sc-772acff9-0 kYsqtw\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">Europe&#x27;s tallest Virgin Mary statue unveiled in rural Poland</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Dundee-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-50abbc98-0 eUixcX\">The 55.6-metre (182ft) concrete figure is head-and-shoulders above Rio de Jaineiro&#x27;s Christ the Redeemer.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataDateStyled-sc-10966952-1 feNzEJ\">9 hrs ago</span><div data-testid=\"card-metadata-separator\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__Separator-sc-10966952-3 decXPj\"></div><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataTagStyled-sc-10966952-2 ewmvhB\">Europe</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 igNVuU\"><div data-testid=\"manchester-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/cwyqq52xkypo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"manchester-article\" class=\"Manchester-styles__CardStyled-sc-5c1d085b-1 cGPaOi\"><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Manchester-styles__TextWrapperStyled-sc-5c1d085b-2 eshOej\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">&#x27;Number of fatalities&#x27; and four injured after car drives on wrong side of Irish motorway</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Manchester-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-5c1d085b-0 coxKqG\">The collision occurred on on the M9 Northbound at about 03:00 local time on Sunday in County Kildare.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataDateStyled-sc-10966952-1 feNzEJ\">48 mins ago</span><div data-testid=\"card-metadata-separator\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__Separator-sc-10966952-3 decXPj\"></div><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataTagStyled-sc-10966952-2 ewmvhB\">Europe</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 dHtWoZ\"><div data-testid=\"manchester-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/cj4kk8kz271o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"manchester-article\" class=\"Manchester-styles__CardStyled-sc-5c1d085b-1 cGPaOi\"><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Manchester-styles__TextWrapperStyled-sc-5c1d085b-2 eshOej\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">Qatar denies capturing three Iranian pilots after downing fighter jets</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Manchester-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-5c1d085b-0 coxKqG\">Iran claims they have been held since Qatar downed two fighter jets at the start of the US-Iran war.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataDateStyled-sc-10966952-1 feNzEJ\">11 hrs ago</span><div data-testid=\"card-metadata-separator\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__Separator-sc-10966952-3 decXPj\"></div><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataTagStyled-sc-10966952-2 ewmvhB\">Middle East</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 pTIUX\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/c5ywwv2pp44o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-article\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardStyled-sc-50abbc98-1 jHXbAb\"><div data-testid=\"card-image-wrapper\" class=\"Dundee-styles__ImageWrapperStyled-sc-50abbc98-3 ejTXUZ\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardMediaStyled-sc-50abbc98-4 gZwtmn\"><div class=\"Im